title: "Decentralized Genomic Profiling & Clinical Outcomes Dashboard"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-15
url: "https://github.com/debanjangangopadhyay/tcf-track-outcomes"
repository-code: "https://github.com/debanjangangopadhyay/tcf-track-outcomes"
abstract: >-
  A clinical decision support framework and biostatistical dashboard for precision oncology. 
  Engineered to evaluate Virtual Molecular Tumor Board (VMTB) matching, calculate 
  progression-free survival (PFS) via Kaplan-Meier estimates and log-rank testing, and 
  analyze circulating tumor fractions for liquid biopsy monitoring.
keywords:
  - precision-oncology
  - survival-analysis
  - bioinformatics
  - clinical-informatics
  - hepatology
  - metabolic-medicine
